## Goal
Visualise how the six samples cluster using PCA on gene counts, coloured by condition. Include all six samples: A1–A3 (untreated) and B1–B3 (treated).

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
below are what they resolve to today.

